{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090020227757321c362e49b6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the complete HTML file with the **Ethereal Emerald & Silk** aesthetic:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc60bc37-71c8-4125-89ee-73080145b86b","uuid":"fee4c595-3040-4e96-911d-66945a7e8092"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090020227757321c362e49b6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_f3bb0d84f33643a6b07266ab","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/dra-priscila-blazzi/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dra. Priscila Blazzi | Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dra. Priscila Blazzi - Especialista em harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto. Transforme sua beleza natural com tratamentos personalizados. Agende: (16) 99174-5408\">\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bodoni+Moda:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,400;1,500&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        /* ========================================\n           CSS VARIABLES & ROOT STYLES\n        ======================================== */\n        :root {\n            /* Colors - Ethereal Emerald & Silk Palette */\n            --color-emerald: #2D7A6E;\n            --color-emerald-light: #4A9A8C;\n            --color-emerald-dark: #1F5A52;\n            --color-emerald-pale: #A8D5CC;\n            --color-emerald-mint: #D4EBE5;\n            --color-silk-cream: #F7F5F0;\n            --color-silk-warm: #F0EDE6;\n            --color-champagne: #C9A86C;\n            --color-champagne-light: #D9BE9A;\n            --color-charcoal: #2A2A2A;\n            --color-charcoal-light: #4A4A4A;\n            --color-taupe: #8B8680;\n            --color-taupe-light: #A8A4A0;\n\n            /* Gradients */\n            --gradient-emerald: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D7A6E 0%, #4A9A8C 100%);\n            --gradient-emerald-soft: linear-gradient(135deg, #A8D5CC 0%, #D4EBE5 100%);\n            --gradient-silk: linear-gradient(135deg, #F7F5F0 0%, #F0EDE6 100%);\n            --gradient-champagne: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A86C 0%, #D9BE9A 100%);\n            --gradient-fade: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(247,245,240,0) 0%, rgba(247,245,240,1) 100%);\n\n            /* Typography */\n            --font-display: 'Bodoni Moda', Georgia, serif;\n            --font-body: 'Source Sans 3', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n\n            /* Spacing */\n            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n            --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n            --spacing-md: 2rem;\n            --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n            --spacing-xl: 6rem;\n            --spacing-xxl: 8rem;\n\n            /* Border Radius */\n            --radius-sm: 8px;\n            --radius-md: 16px;\n            --radius-lg: 24px;\n            --radius-pill: 100px;\n            --radius-ellipse: 70% 30% / 30% 70% 70% 30%;\n            --radius-ellipse-2: 30% 70% / 70% 30% 30% 70%;\n            --radius-ellipse-3: 50% 40% / 40% 50% 60% 50%;\n\n            /* Shadows */\n            --shadow-soft: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 122, 110, 0.15);\n            --shadow-glow: 0 8px 48px rgba(201, 168, 108, 0.2);\n            --shadow-elegant: 0 16px 64px rgba(42, 42, 42, 0.08);\n            --shadow-floating: 0 20px 60px rgba(45, 122, 110, 0.18);\n\n            /* Transitions */\n            --transition-fast: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            --transition-base: 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            --transition-slow: 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           RESET & BASE STYLES\n        ======================================== */\n        *, *::before, *::after {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            background: var(--color-silk-cream);\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        ul {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           TYPOGRAPHY\n        ======================================== */\n        h1, h2, h3, h4 {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n        }\n\n        .text-emerald { color: var(--color-emerald); }\n        .text-champagne { color: var(--color-champagne); }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           NAVIGATION\n        ======================================== */\n        .nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: rgba(247, 245, 240, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            z-index: 1000;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-base);\n            box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(45, 122, 110, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .nav.hidden {\n            transform: translateY(-100%);\n        }\n\n        .nav-container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 2rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-emerald);\n            transition: width var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--color-emerald);\n            color: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background: var(--color-emerald-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .mobile-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .mobile-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-charcoal);\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           HERO SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .hero {\n            position: relative;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n        }\n\n        .hero-ellipses {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .ellipse {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ellipse);\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            opacity: 0.5;\n            animation: ellipse-float 20s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .ellipse-1 {\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            top: -10%;\n            right: -5%;\n            animation-delay: 0s;\n        }\n\n        .ellipse-2 {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald-soft);\n            bottom: -5%;\n            left: -10%;\n            animation-delay: -5s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ellipse-2);\n        }\n\n        .ellipse-3 {\n            width: 350px;\n            height: 350px;\n            background: var(--gradient-champagne);\n            top: 40%;\n            left: 30%;\n            animation-delay: -10s;\n            opacity: 0.35;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ellipse-3);\n        }\n\n        .ellipse-4 {\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 300px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A8D5CC 0%, #F7F5F0 100%);\n            bottom: 20%;\n            right: 20%;\n            animation-delay: -15s;\n            opacity: 0.25;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ellipse);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes ellipse-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1) rotate(0deg);\n            }\n            25% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -30px) scale(1.05) rotate(5deg);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.95) rotate(-5deg);\n            }\n            75% {\n                transform: translate(-30px, -20px) scale(1.02) rotate(3deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .hero-container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            background: rgba(45, 122, 110, 0.15);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.2s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge svg {\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.4s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title span {\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n        }\n\n        .hero-description {\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n            max-width: 500px;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.6s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-ctas {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.8s both;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            border: none;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--color-emerald);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-emerald-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background: transparent;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-emerald);\n            color: white;\n            border-color: var(--color-emerald);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        .btn svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image {\n            position: relative;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.4s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            opacity: 0.15;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card {\n            position: absolute;\n            background: white;\n            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            z-index: 10;\n            animation: card-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card.card-1 {\n            top: 10%;\n            left: -20px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card.card-2 {\n            bottom: 15%;\n            right: -20px;\n            animation-delay: -3s;\n        }\n\n        .card-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .card-icon svg {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .card-text {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .card-text span {\n            display: block;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes card-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translateY(-15px);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fade-up {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(30px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SECTIONS\n        ======================================== */\n        .section {\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .section-subtitle {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-description {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           PROBLEM/SOLUTION SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .problem-solution {\n            background: var(--color-silk-cream);\n        }\n\n        .problem-solution-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .ps-card {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .ps-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            transform: scaleY(0);\n            transition: transform var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card:hover::before {\n            transform: scaleY(1);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .ps-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald-soft);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .ps-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .ps-card.problem .ps-icon {\n            background: rgba(139, 134, 128, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card.problem .ps-icon svg {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SERVICES SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .services {\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n        }\n\n        .services-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .service-image {\n            height: 200px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .service-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-slow);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover .service-image img {\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n\n        .service-content {\n            padding: 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-top: -50px;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .service-card p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-link {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: gap var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-link:hover {\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-link svg {\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           TESTIMONIALS SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .testimonials {\n            background: var(--color-emerald);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .testimonials::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.05'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-subtitle {\n            color: var(--color-emerald-mint);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-title {\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-description {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            color: var(--color-champagne);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-text {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-author {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-avatar {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info h4 {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info span {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           DIFFERENTIALS SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .differentials {\n            background: var(--color-silk-cream);\n        }\n\n        .differentials-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .differential-item {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item:hover {\n            background: white;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .diff-icon {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .diff-icon::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -4px;\n            left: -4px;\n            right: -4px;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-emerald-pale);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            animation: pulse-ring 2s ease-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-ring {\n            0% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: scale(1.2);\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .diff-icon svg {\n            width: 28px;\n            height: 28px;\n            color: white;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        .diff-content h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .diff-content p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           CONTACT SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .contact {\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n        }\n\n        .contact-container {\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info {\n            padding: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-details {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--gradient-emerald-soft);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-icon svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text h4 {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text p {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-label {\n            display: block;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-input,\n        .form-select,\n        .form-textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0.875rem 1rem;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-silk-warm);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            background: var(--color-silk-cream);\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .form-input:focus,\n        .form-select:focus,\n        .form-textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--color-emerald);\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .form-textarea {\n            min-height: 120px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            background: var(--color-emerald);\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit:hover {\n            background: var(--color-emerald-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .form-submit svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           FOOTER\n        ======================================== */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--color-charcoal);\n            color: white;\n            padding: var(--spacing-lg) 2rem var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .footer-content {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 3rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand h3 {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe-light);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-emerald-pale);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links ul {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            color: var(--color-taupe-light);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: var(--color-emerald-pale);\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-emerald-pale);\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact-item svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            color: var(--color-emerald);\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact-item span {\n            color: var(--color-taupe-light);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            padding-top: 2rem;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           ANIMATIONS\n        ======================================== */\n        .wow-fade-up {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(30px);\n            transition: all 0.6s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-up.visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-in {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.6s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-in.visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           RESPONSIVE\n        ======================================== */\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .hero-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-description {\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n            }\n\n            .hero-ctas {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-floating-card {\n                display: none;\n            }\n\n            .contact-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-menu {\n                display: none;\n            }\n\n            .mobile-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.active {\n                display: flex;\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 100%;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background: white;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: 2rem;\n                gap: 1rem;\n                box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n            }\n\n            .section {\n                padding: var(--spacing-lg) 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-ctas {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n\n            .btn {\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            h1 {\n                font-size: 2.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-badge {\n                font-size: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .service-card,\n            .testimonial-card,\n            .ps-card {\n                padding: 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .contact-form-wrapper {\n                padding: 1.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            *, *::before, *::after {\n                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-logo\">Dra. Priscila Blazzi</a>\n            <div class=\"mobile-toggle\" id=\"mobileToggle\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-link\">Início</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"nav-link\">Serviços</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\" class=\"nav-link\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#diferenciais\" class=\"nav-link\">Diferenciais</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contato\" class=\"nav-cta\">Agendar Consulta</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-ellipses\">\n            <div class=\"ellipse ellipse-1\" data-parallax=\"0.05\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ellipse ellipse-2\" data-parallax=\"0.03\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ellipse ellipse-3\" data-parallax=\"0.04\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ellipse ellipse-4\" data-parallax=\"0.02\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-container\">\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-badge\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                    Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Sua beleza natural, <span>elevada à perfeição</span></h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">Transforme sua aparência com tratamentos estéticos personalizados e resultados naturais. Tecnologia avançada com o cuidado que você merece.</p>\n                <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                        Agendar Consulta\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">\n                        Conhecer Tratamentos\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-image\">\n                <div class=\"hero-image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629909613654-28e377c37b09?w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Harmonização Facial\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-floating-card card-1\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-text\">\n                        Resultados Naturais\n                        <span>Procedimentos personalizados</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-floating-card card-2\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-text\">\n                        Consulta Rápida\n                        <span>Atendimento em 24h</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->\n    <section class=\"section problem-solution\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Sua Jornada</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Transforme sua autoestima</h2>\n            <p class=\"section-description\">Entenda como podemos ajudar você a alcançar a aparência que sempre desejou</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"problem-solution-grid\">\n            <div class=\"ps-card problem wow-fade-up\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9.172 16.172a4 4 0 015.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Insatisfação com a aparência</h3>\n                <p>Sente-se incomodada com sinais de envelhecimento, assimetrias ou perda de volume no rosto que afetam sua confiança.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ps-card problem wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Dúvidas sobre procedimentos</h3>\n                <p>Não sabe qual tratamento é ideal para você ou tem receio de resultados artificiais e exagerados.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ps-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Beleza natural e harmoniosa</h3>\n                <p>Realce seus traços naturais com procedimentos que proporcionam resultados sutis e elegantes.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ps-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"300\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Segurança e profissionalismo</h3>\n                <p>Atendimento com técnica apurada, produtos de alta qualidade e total segurança durante todo o processo.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"section services\" id=\"servicos\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Tratamentos</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Procedimentos especializados</h2>\n  