rm data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n    53→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic with soft greens and creamy whites\n    54→\n    55→---\n    56→\n    57→## 2024-02-08 - US-049\n    58→- Created complete website for Dra. Lara Costa - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    59→- Files changed:\n    60→  - `site-demo/dra-lara-costa/index.html` (new)\n    61→- **Design Concept**: Serene Sage & Pearl aesthetic with soft greens, creamy whites, and pearl/golden accents. Fresh, natural, and premium feel distinct from the rose/gold palette of US-048. Organic blob shapes with dual organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n    62→- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Inter (body) for modern, elegant readability\n    63→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    64→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    65→  - Dual organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n    66→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    67→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n    68→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    69→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n    70→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    71→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    72→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    73→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    74→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    75→- **Contact Info**: Rua Milton José Robusti, 75 - Sala 506 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-613 | (16) 99788-7923\n    76→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n  